[{"answer":"You know when you went to the Shetland Islands last year, Paul?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you go by ferry or did you fly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/2.mp3"},{"answer":"We went by ferry, Tammy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I prefer driving to flying - the journey feels like part of the holiday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Which ferry company did you use?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/5.mp3"},{"answer":"There's only one - it's called Northern Ferries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The ferries all leave from Aberdeen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/7.mp3"},{"answer":"How frequent are they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/8.mp3"},{"answer":"The service is pretty limited -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/9.mp3"},{"answer":"there's only one ferry leaving every evening in summer anyway, seven days a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure about the winter months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/11.mp3"},{"answer":"They may only run on four or five days then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. So it's an overnight trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I quite like that idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Leaving at night and waking up as you arrive on the island.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you remember how much you paid for your tickets?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/16.mp3"},{"answer":"They were really cheap","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and four people and a car worked out at just under £250.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I was expecting it to be more like £400 during the peak season.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So was I. It's great value.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a good idea to book in advance","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/22.mp3"},{"answer":"because I think they get booked up quite quickly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/23.mp3"},{"answer":"especially during the school holidays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I suppose so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm just not 100% sure of our plans yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/26.mp3"},{"answer":"What if I had to cancel?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That could be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think it's their policy to give refunds, just a voucher,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/29.mp3"},{"answer":"which you can use at a later date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/30.mp3"},{"answer":"But you have to cancel a month in advance to get that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we need to make up our minds quickly then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/33.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd want to book a cabin too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/34.mp3"},{"answer":"We booked too late to get a cabin with a window.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/35.mp3"},{"answer":"They're more expensive but much nicer than the inner cabins.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/36.mp3"},{"answer":"You don't have to book a cabin at all but I think it's worth paying for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/37.mp3"},{"answer":"They also have luxury cabins, which are only for two people and have a TV","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but I wouldn't bother with those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/39.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/40.mp3"},{"answer":"The only other thing I can think of is to make sure you bring snacks for the kids.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/41.mp3"},{"answer":"The selection on board is quite limited and not that healthy either.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/42.mp3"},{"answer":"What about wifi on board?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that any good?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/45.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's best to bring some books for them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/46.mp3"},{"answer":"We may need to bring the dog if I can't get anyone to look after him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/47.mp3"},{"answer":"We brought ours and it was fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The kennels on board are okay, they're quite big,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/49.mp3"},{"answer":"you just need to provide a blanket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/51.mp3"},{"answer":"It was all very easy really","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and it was quite an adventure for the kids.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/53.mp3"},{"answer":"They loved being on the sea at night and in the morning keeping a lookout for dolphins -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/54.mp3"},{"answer":"we saw loads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, the kids would love that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/56.mp3"},{"answer":"One other thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/57.mp3"},{"answer":"We arrived in Aberdeen hours before the ferry was due to leave","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/58.mp3"},{"answer":"so we decided to go somewhere else rather than hang around at the port for so long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Where did you go?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Drum Castle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never heard of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that spelt like the instrument?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. It's really worth visiting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/64.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got an impressive tower and beautiful gardens and ancient woodland.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Does it have a restaurant?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/67.mp3"},{"answer":"It's only got a coffee shop, no restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/68.mp3"},{"answer":"We looked up restaurants in the area and found an Italian one in a village nearby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I can check the name of it for you if you're interested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh thanks Paul...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-3-part-1-2026-07-16-17-14-04/71.mp3"}]
